@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+---
+id: task-002-fix-free-shipping-boundary-at-exactly-50-euro
+type: task
+title: "Fix free-shipping boundary at exactly 50 euro"
+status: pending
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Marco (customer) reported being charged €4.90 delivery on a basket that came to exactly €50.00 after
+discount, even though the site says delivery is free from €50.
+
+## Root cause
+
+The README states: "Shipping is free when the goods come to €50.00 or more, after every discount and
+before VAT." `shippingCost` in `src/shipping.ts` used `goods > FREE_SHIPPING_FROM_CENTS`, which only
+waived shipping strictly above €50.00, charging it at exactly €50.00.
+
+## Fix
+
+`src/shipping.ts`: changed the comparison to `goods >= FREE_SHIPPING_FROM_CENTS`.
+
+## Tests
+
+Added a red-first test in `test/orders.test.ts` ("ships free when the goods come to exactly the
+free-shipping amount") ordering 5 × MUG-01 at €10.00 = exactly €50.00 of goods, asserting
+`shippingCents` is 0. It failed before the fix and passes after.
diff --git a/docs/memory/task/task-003-fix-vat-rounding-truncating-instead-of-rounding-half-up.md b/docs/memory/task/task-003-fix-vat-rounding-truncating-instead-of-rounding-half-up.md
